OL,3,ANvidia boss rejects AI extinction fears
OL,4,Aas 'doomsday narratives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia CEO Jensen Huang has described
OL,7,Fwarnings that AI could lead to
OL,8,Fhumanity's extinction by the next
OL,9,Fdecade as "doomsday narratives".
OL,11,F"2030 is not going to be the end of the
OL,12,Fworld. There is 0% chance that's going
OL,13,Fto be the end of the world", Huang said
OL,14,Fin an interview with CBS News, the
OL,15,FBBC's US partner.
OL,17,FHuang added: "Scaring people is
OL,18,Funnecessary. It is irresponsible."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
