OL,3,ANvidia boss rejects AI extinction fears
OL,4,Aas 'doomsday narratives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarnings from researchers in recent
OL,7,Fweeks about potential risks posed by
OL,8,Fthe technology escalated the debate
OL,9,Fabout AI safety, with some industry
OL,10,Fexecutives calling for a slowdown in
OL,11,Fdeveloping models.
